{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109090006858-1109_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261109090006\"/><p>事發在丸善淳久堂書店。</p><p>日本大阪市周日（8日）發生持刀傷人事件，造成一人受傷。事發在北區繁華商業區的丸善淳久堂書店，傷者是一名23歲男職員，他的腿部受傷暫無生命危險。</p><p>事發於早上11時15分左右，傷者工作期間突然被人從背後持刀刺傷大腿。警員以涉嫌傷害罪，當場逮捕一名30多歲男疑犯。他與傷者互不認識，供稱因怨恨社會而犯案。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.482449+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T01:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:11.755169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:41.318823+00:00","content_hash":"c8d42670a8bc075be5dd0409b96e971585052a8860b8e1b41d778aeecd119c17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.482449+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}